# Known non-passing cases of the blygger-spec reader suite for Burrow
# (scripts/reader-conformance.sh, docs/CONFORMANCE-READER.md).
# One "<status> <case id>" per line. Every case not listed must pass.
# A case listed here that now passes is reported as fixed; take it out.
fail directive-label
fail directive-label-remote
fail directive-label-escaped
fail directive-label-pipe
fail directive-label-partial
fail partial-lazy-continuation
fail partial-of-thread-reaches-its-quote
fail closure-contains-self
fail local-nested-thread
fail markdown-relative-links
fail markdown-relative-image
warn tk-output-own-line-directive
